(4262109, 614966, 47470, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see the muscles defined a bit more</td>', 'I would have liked to see the muscles defined a bit more', '2007-11-21 03:24:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262174, 614921, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting. Please let me know if I''m right:<br/> <br/>One light into umbrella at camera left (maybe into a softbox or shoot-through), maybe a reflector on the right.<br/> <br/>One smaller light at the background?<br/> <br/>I like this shot. Technically very good but doesn''t really convey much of the ''streets'' to me.</td>', 'Nice lighting. Please let me know if I''m right: One light into umbrella at camera left (maybe into a softbox or shoot-through), maybe a reflector on the right. One smaller light at the background? I like this shot. Technically very good but doesn''t really convey much of the ''streets'' to me.', '2007-11-21 05:10:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262175, 615216, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice pic, shame the AF point is locked on the middle of the pic and not her eyes though. Also, could do with a bit of oopmh in there, maybe do a levels adjustment to add a bit more shape to it?</td>', 'Nice pic, shame the AF point is locked on the middle of the pic and not her eyes though. Also, could do with a bit of oopmh in there, maybe do a levels adjustment to add a bit more shape to it?', '2007-11-21 05:11:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262176, 615074, 78062, '<td valign="top">Shame the focus is a bit off, and the colour of the border just reminds me of something scatological :) Not a bad pic but looks like a snapshot more than an artistic photogrpah. Maybe a better angle could have helped things? Getting right down next to the face perhaps? Nice job though.</td>', 'Shame the focus is a bit off, and the colour of the border just reminds me of something scatological :) Not a bad pic but looks like a snapshot more than an artistic photogrpah. Maybe a better angle could have helped things? Getting right down next to the face perhaps? Nice job though.', '2007-11-21 05:13:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262178, 614870, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, needs contrast though. Looks damned flat as it is. I can''t see a single white pixel. i do like it though, reminds of me of the old film photographs.</td>', 'Nice idea, needs contrast though. Looks damned flat as it is. I can''t see a single white pixel. i do like it though, reminds of me of the old film photographs.', '2007-11-21 05:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262180, 614692, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice pic :) Would make a good ad campaign for someone. Needs more blood though...</td>', 'Nice pic :) Would make a good ad campaign for someone. Needs more blood though...', '2007-11-21 05:15:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262182, 614421, 78062, '<td valign="top">I like the crop of this and the central focal point of it too. Not sure why it''s in negative- it doesn''t really help it along. Cool sky though.</td>', 'I like the crop of this and the central focal point of it too. Not sure why it''s in negative- it doesn''t really help it along. Cool sky though.', '2007-11-21 05:16:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262183, 614967, 78062, '<td valign="top">erm... thats not the best job i''ve seen of adding an outside element into a picture. You should have erased all around the other layer you put on top of the background, it works a lot cleaner. You must have magic powers to do this in ''basic editing'', or just not read the rules. Even so, the picture isn''t very good as it is- flat, boring and the only interesting thing is that that bridge has a maximum height allowance of 4.5m, and as you can see, that isn''t very interesting at all. Better luck next time.</td>', 'erm... thats not the best job i''ve seen of adding an outside element into a picture. You should have erased all around the other layer you put on top of the background, it works a lot cleaner. You must have magic powers to do this in ''basic editing'', or just not read the rules. Even so, the picture isn''t very good as it is- flat, boring and the only interesting thing is that that bridge has a maximum height allowance of 4.5m, and as you can see, that isn''t very interesting at all. Better luck next time.', '2007-11-21 05:19:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262185, 614953, 34938, '<td valign="top">best one in the challenge...hope you ribbon</td>', 'best one in the challenge...hope you ribbon', '2007-11-21 05:20:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262186, 614022, 78062, '<td valign="top">interesting crop, you would have scored brownie points if he was looking ove rhis shoulder at you but I don''t mind this. I like how you caught him mid-strum.</td>', 'interesting crop, you would have scored brownie points if he was looking ove rhis shoulder at you but I don''t mind this. I like how you caught him mid-strum.', '2007-11-21 05:20:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262187, 614655, 78062, '<td valign="top">mmmmm... noise.</td>', 'mmmmm... noise.', '2007-11-21 05:20:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262190, 615235, 78062, '<td valign="top">Nice picture... not sure how this meets the challenge as it has nothing to do with a street, looks like a kid playing in his back yard looking less than amazed by something. It''s very grey too, maybe sliding the left slider of the levels option would help this pop a little bit. Nice pic, but DNMC for me/</td>', 'Nice picture... not sure how this meets the challenge as it has nothing to do with a street, looks like a kid playing in his back yard looking less than amazed by something. It''s very grey too, maybe sliding the left slider of the levels option would help this pop a little bit. Nice pic, but DNMC for me/', '2007-11-21 05:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262193, 613941, 78062, '<td valign="top">That''s some beefy distortion you have there :) Nice capture.</td>', 'That''s some beefy distortion you have there :) Nice capture.', '2007-11-21 05:23:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262194, 613896, 78062, '<td valign="top">this would have been great if it wasn''t for the noise and maybe a bit more contrast to bring out the shadows a bit more.</td>', 'this would have been great if it wasn''t for the noise and maybe a bit more contrast to bring out the shadows a bit more.', '2007-11-21 05:23:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262203, 614969, 78062, '<td valign="top">You meant ''book smarts'' right? Interesting choice of pic but the angle makes it look a bit like she''s mooning me. I think a profile view would have proven a bit more flattering, this seems bordering on the gratuitous... not that I''m against that kind of thing you understand.<br/> <br/>Also, i think it needs a bit more contrast to give it a bit more depth, or curves, or something extra.</td>', 'You meant ''book smarts'' right? Interesting choice of pic but the angle makes it look a bit like she''s mooning me. I think a profile view would have proven a bit more flattering, this seems bordering on the gratuitous... not that I''m against that kind of thing you understand. Also, i think it needs a bit more contrast to give it a bit more depth, or curves, or something extra.', '2007-11-21 05:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262206, 615026, 78062, '<td valign="top">Looks like a 1970s western movie. And I don''t mean because of the setting, but the look of it. Good one. Just needs a cowboy looking puzzled at that sign and you have it.</td>', 'Looks like a 1970s western movie. And I don''t mean because of the setting, but the look of it. Good one. Just needs a cowboy looking puzzled at that sign and you have it.', '2007-11-21 05:32:38.000000', NULL, 1),
