(4262272, 613941, 39430, '<td valign="top">Ah, there''s a lot of clues here - is that you, hotpasta?  :)  Not a bad image, although a little blown in the highlights, mainly the shirt.  There''s also a bit much space for my liking, with the amp taking a subtle centre stage, and the artist falling off the edge of the frame.  Would be nice to edit out the barrel distortion too.  Still, overall, not a bad image.</td>', 'Ah, there''s a lot of clues here - is that you, hotpasta?  :)  Not a bad image, although a little blown in the highlights, mainly the shirt.  There''s also a bit much space for my liking, with the amp taking a subtle centre stage, and the artist falling off the edge of the frame.  Would be nice to edit out the barrel distortion too.  Still, overall, not a bad image.', '2007-11-21 07:25:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4262299, 614990, 48086, '<td valign="top">ive no idea what i am looking at, but i really like this as an abstract picture. strong light and shadow, simple yet elegant. not really on topic, as far as i can see, but 7 still</td>', 'ive no idea what i am looking at, but i really like this as an abstract picture. strong light and shadow, simple yet elegant. not really on topic, as far as i can see, but 7 still', '2007-11-21 07:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
