(4263848, 613941, 33672, '<td valign="top">NYC metro? Man I was just there but it was a bass player in Ascott PL and a vocalist at 14th street. Great street photography!</td>', 'NYC metro? Man I was just there but it was a bass player in Ascott PL and a vocalist at 14th street. Great street photography!', '2007-11-21 21:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
