(4269465, 614692, 66060, '<td valign="top">Need''s stronger PP, hand feels too small and the USP still looks too clean. Didn''t even notice the blood till the end, needs more UMPH over all.. 5</td>', 'Need''s stronger PP, hand feels too small and the USP still looks too clean. Didn''t even notice the blood till the end, needs more UMPH over all.. 5', '2007-11-26 10:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
