(4269751, 614393, 72268, '<td valign="top">A little overexposed around the subject. The comp would be better if it was cropped to where he was more off to the side rather than straight in the midddle. Also, next time I would try to get a little more of his face, as this brings out more emotion in a photo where the subject is a person.</td>', 'A little overexposed around the subject. The comp would be better if it was cropped to where he was more off to the side rather than straight in the midddle. Also, next time I would try to get a little more of his face, as this brings out more emotion in a photo where the subject is a person.', '2007-11-26 13:59:42.000000', NULL, 1),
