(4272144, 614511, 74534, '<td valign="top">Wouldn''t normally care for the blown sky, or the cut-legs composition, but matches the challenge perfectly so a high score from me. Suggestion for blown overcast sky: convert to black &amp; white. The colored stripes steal too much attention from the face anyway.</td>', 'Wouldn''t normally care for the blown sky, or the cut-legs composition, but matches the challenge perfectly so a high score from me. Suggestion for blown overcast sky: convert to black & white. The colored stripes steal too much attention from the face anyway.', '2007-11-27 22:29:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272149, 614833, 74534, '<td valign="top">I could see this framed and on the wall of a jazz club... Something about it I really like. Would it work better with a person in the background? Not sure...</td>', 'I could see this framed and on the wall of a jazz club... Something about it I really like. Would it work better with a person in the background? Not sure...', '2007-11-27 22:32:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272150, 614966, 74534, '<td valign="top">Very good challenge rendition, facial expression and contrast with the t-shirt. There''s something about it that I don''t really like... I think it''s the background with it''s dominating mid-tone gray.</td>', 'Very good challenge rendition, facial expression and contrast with the t-shirt. There''s something about it that I don''t really like... I think it''s the background with it''s dominating mid-tone gray.', '2007-11-27 22:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272155, 614349, 74534, '<td valign="top">Very good portrait, seems to capture the essence of the individual. I don''t normally like a point of view from below the face, but here it seems to work well.</td>', 'Very good portrait, seems to capture the essence of the individual. I don''t normally like a point of view from below the face, but here it seems to work well.', '2007-11-27 22:35:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272158, 615241, 74534, '<td valign="top">I really like the expression, and the way it works with your choice of processing. Good job, and quite unique. I''m not generally a big fan of taking pics of homeless people, but you went with it in a different direction, and it works.</td>', 'I really like the expression, and the way it works with your choice of processing. Good job, and quite unique. I''m not generally a big fan of taking pics of homeless people, but you went with it in a different direction, and it works.', '2007-11-27 22:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272165, 615203, 74534, '<td valign="top">OK, this is definitely something else... very unique. Yes, it does say street smart to me. Also makes me wonder what the strange pose is about, very non-conventional in a good way. I would have suggested toning the flash down by about a stop and getting a bit more ambient light in though.</td>', 'OK, this is definitely something else... very unique. Yes, it does say street smart to me. Also makes me wonder what the strange pose is about, very non-conventional in a good way. I would have suggested toning the flash down by about a stop and getting a bit more ambient light in though.', '2007-11-27 22:40:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272170, 615209, 74534, '<td valign="top">10 from me. Such simple composition and yet such a perfect challenge interpretation. My choice for red ribbon.</td>', '10 from me. Such simple composition and yet such a perfect challenge interpretation. My choice for red ribbon.', '2007-11-27 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272171, 615232, 74534, '<td valign="top">Bumping to 10. Excellent challenge interpretation. Street smarts is the first thing this image makes me think of. The blur and blown highlights somehow add to the non-conventional feel. That''s what the street is about, right? Like the off-centered composition as well. My choice for blue ribbon.</td>', 'Bumping to 10. Excellent challenge interpretation. Street smarts is the first thing this image makes me think of. The blur and blown highlights somehow add to the non-conventional feel. That''s what the street is about, right? Like the off-centered composition as well. My choice for blue ribbon.', '2007-11-27 22:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272172, 614953, 74534, '<td valign="top">One of the better street performer images in the challenge. I guess it''s the lighting that "makes" it. Bump to 8.</td>', 'One of the better street performer images in the challenge. I guess it''s the lighting that "makes" it. Bump to 8.', '2007-11-27 22:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272173, 614740, 74534, '<td valign="top">Something about this I really like. Maybe the centered composition? Maybe the blurred hand? Maybe the lighting with a dark stripe right down the middle? Probably all: non-conventional, which is what the street is about. My choice for yellow ribbon.</td>', 'Something about this I really like. Maybe the centered composition? Maybe the blurred hand? Maybe the lighting with a dark stripe right down the middle? Probably all: non-conventional, which is what the street is about. My choice for yellow ribbon.', '2007-11-27 22:41:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272232, 615104, 43656, '<td valign="top">The eye wanders out of the frame with the sword.  It would have been better to have framed the entire sword into the image</td>', 'The eye wanders out of the frame with the sword.  It would have been better to have framed the entire sword into the image', '2007-11-27 23:15:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272263, 614449, 67258, '<td valign="top">This almost seems to parody the requisite Autumnal fungii photos!</td>', 'This almost seems to parody the requisite Autumnal fungii photos!', '2007-11-27 23:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272264, 614633, 67258, '<td valign="top">This picture absolutely nail the challenge for me - and is very strong photographically, too.  The environmental set couldn''t be better if it had been stage managed,  but it is the direct eye-contact of the man walking into the shot - challenging, curious - that makes this so very successful.</td>', 'This picture absolutely nail the challenge for me - and is very strong photographically, too.  The environmental set couldn''t be better if it had been stage managed,  but it is the direct eye-contact of the man walking into the shot - challenging, curious - that makes this so very successful.', '2007-11-27 23:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272265, 614020, 67258, '<td valign="top">What an incredible photo!  The repetitive walls f0rm an interesting lead in line, with the placement of the mechanic spot on.  The diagonals make this very strong compositionally - my eye is led in initially by the blue walls then along the back wall to the fr left, and back diagonally via the inspection pit placed on the ''third'' to the mechanic.  The processing is just right for the photo, with the emphasis on textures.  But it is the ambiguity, the story that really makes this.  A garage with no car, a mechanic with no work.  excellent.</td>', 'What an incredible photo!  The repetitive walls f0rm an interesting lead in line, with the placement of the mechanic spot on.  The diagonals make this very strong compositionally - my eye is led in initially by the blue walls then along the back wall to the fr left, and back diagonally via the inspection pit placed on the ''third'' to the mechanic.  The processing is just right for the photo, with the emphasis on textures.  But it is the ambiguity, the story that really makes this.  A garage with no car, a mechanic with no work.  excellent.', '2007-11-27 23:47:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272266, 615047, 67258, '<td valign="top">Wow, this photo exudes dynamism.</td>', 'Wow, this photo exudes dynamism.', '2007-11-27 23:47:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272273, 614349, 67258, '<td valign="top">What an intriguing photograph - the old gentleman, almost looking as though he has fallen through the space/time continuum, hands folded and eyes raised to heaven as though in prayer, the modern transport (a minibus pehaps?) and the case placed carefully and neatly in the foreground.</td>', 'What an intriguing photograph - the old gentleman, almost looking as though he has fallen through the space/time continuum, hands folded and eyes raised to heaven as though in prayer, the modern transport (a minibus pehaps?) and the case placed carefully and neatly in the foreground.', '2007-11-27 23:51:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272274, 614049, 67258, '<td valign="top">What a great find - certainly one of those ''decisive moments''.</td>', 'What a great find - certainly one of those ''decisive moments''.', '2007-11-27 23:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272275, 614953, 67258, '<td valign="top">Love the lighting on this.  The composition and pose of the model are good, too.</td>', 'Love the lighting on this.  The composition and pose of the model are good, too.', '2007-11-27 23:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272276, 614858, 67258, '<td valign="top">Ambiguous - won''t survive without what? Legs, the media, cars, people? Certainly makes me stop, view the photo, and think.</td>', 'Ambiguous - won''t survive without what? Legs, the media, cars, people? Certainly makes me stop, view the photo, and think.', '2007-11-27 23:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272278, 613919, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lol!</td>', 'Lol!', '2007-11-27 23:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4272284, 615232, 67258, '<td valign="top">Clever use of the Virgin sign, although I might have been tempted to place the model just a little further to the right of it so that the connection takes a second or two longer for the viewer to make. The stretch limo certainly adds to the feel of the shot - interesting capture.</td>', 'Clever use of the Virgin sign, although I might have been tempted to place the model just a little further to the right of it so that the connection takes a second or two longer for the viewer to make. The stretch limo certainly adds to the feel of the shot - interesting capture.', '2007-11-27 23:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
