(4273195, 615232, 20882, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the great scores.  I shot this with the idea that the streets are always moving, over-stimulating, and teaming with energy.  The blown out highlights and slight movement in the capture are intentional.  I think this lost me some points, but overall I am really happy with the capture, the scores, and the comments.  Thanks to my incredibly talented neighbor, Kendra Morris, who modeled for this shot.  May I add that she is quite a musician.<br/>Thanks to all,<br/>Robert Shupe</td>', 'Thanks for all of the great scores.  I shot this with the idea that the streets are always moving, over-stimulating, and teaming with energy.  The blown out highlights and slight movement in the capture are intentional.  I think this lost me some points, but overall I am really happy with the capture, the scores, and the comments.  Thanks to my incredibly talented neighbor, Kendra Morris, who modeled for this shot.  May I add that she is quite a musician.Thanks to all,Robert Shupe', '2007-11-28 08:50:35.000000', NULL, 0),
