(4276015, 615129, 85418, '<td valign="top">WHAT A SHOCKER!!!  Thanks to all who voted for me.  Originally I was going to use my little camera for the fuzzy/noisy effect, but decided against it and added my other camera''s so I could use them in the challenge.  I was on holiday and saw the opportunity for the perfect shot for the challenge.  After giving her a few coins and a bagette I had just purchased, I was able to take several shots of her...this being what I thought to be the best.  Thanks again to all!</td>', 'WHAT A SHOCKER!!!  Thanks to all who voted for me.  Originally I was going to use my little camera for the fuzzy/noisy effect, but decided against it and added my other camera''s so I could use them in the challenge.  I was on holiday and saw the opportunity for the perfect shot for the challenge.  After giving her a few coins and a bagette I had just purchased, I was able to take several shots of her...this being what I thought to be the best.  Thanks again to all!', '2007-11-29 11:10:12.000000', NULL, 0),
